    "description": {
      "chat": "",
      "unidentified": "",
      "value": "<p>A stationary 20-foot-radius, 60-foot-high cylinder deals 1d6 fire damage per two caster levels each round for rounds 1-3, maximum 5d6. It then deals 1d6 fire damage each round for rounds 4-6. No saving throw applies; spell resistance does.</p><p>The material components are a small amount of brimstone and one drop of the caster's blood or equivalent fluid.</p><p><strong>Automation boundary:</strong> Place the cylinder and roll the appropriate per-round damage manually; the system does not schedule its six damage pulses.</p>"
    },
